        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=6$",
          "worked": "By the Power of a Point Theorem,\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2&=9\\times4\\\\x^2&=36\\\\x&=6.\\end{align*}$$\nTake the positive root since $x$ is a length.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
